---
// FILE: src/pages/products/flax-hull-lignans.astro
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

const pageTitle = 'Flax Hull Lignans — '
const PRICE_FHL_CENTS = 3900
const PRICE_FHL_DISPLAY = `$${(PRICE_FHL_CENTS / 100).toFixed(2)}`
const PRICE_ANCIENT_CENTS = 4500
const PRICE_ANCIENT_DISPLAY = `$${(PRICE_ANCIENT_CENTS / 100).toFixed(2)}`
---

<BaseLayout>
  <Fragment slot="title">{pageTitle}</Fragment>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="prod-hero">
    <img class="bg" src="/images/products/FHLSingleGreen.png" alt="" />
    <div class="inner">
      <h1>Flax Hull Lignans</h1>
      <p>
        Concentrated SDG lignans from flax hulls to support hormone balance, healthy inflammation
        response, and incredible immune system support. Studies show increase in CD4 counts when you take lignans regularly. Pure, potent, and easy to add to smoothies, yogurt,
        or water.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prodpg">
    <div class="prodpg__container">
      <h2 class="products-title sr-only">Products</h2>

      <div class="prodpg__grid">
        <!-- Card: Flax Hull Lignans (Single Jar) -->
        <article class="prodpg__card">
          <div class="card-photo">
            <img
              src="/images/products/flaxfield.jpg"
              alt="Flax Hull Lignans (Single Jar)"
              loading="eager"
              decoding="async"
              class="card-photo-img"
            />
          </div>
          <h3 class="prodpg__title">
            Flax Hull Lignans
            <span class="unit">(Single Jar)</span>
          </h3>

          <p class="prodpg__price">{PRICE_FHL_DISPLAY}</p>

          <p class="prodpg__desc">
            Concentrated SDG lignans from brown flax hulls—simple daily scoop for foundational wellness. We have the ORIGINAL flax hull lignans….don’t accept *inferior chemically extracted copycat products. Our lignans use the MCP extraction process which guarantees the enzymes have not been activated yet and there are no chemical extraction residues left in our lignans.

Concentrated MCP Processed Flax Hull Lignans give your body what it needs to keep your immune system working strongly. FHL is not the same as whole ground flax. Whole ground flax naturally has a small amount of lignans in it because it includes the shell of the flaxseed, and the shell is where the lignans are. However, you’d still need to consume 2 gallons of whole ground flax seed a day to get the immune system supporting power in 1.5 teaspoons of these concentrated Flax Hull Lignans! Using a special process called “the MCP process,” the lignans are extracted from the shell of the flax seed and concentrated into powder form. There is no seed in this product, only lignans from the shell. Each 1.5 teaspoon sized serving has from 150-300 mg of SDG (the dominant lignan) as well as all of the other lignans in the flax seed shell.   Manufacturer recommends 1 scoop daily for adults, and 1/2 scoop for children.  Scoop is included in jar. MCP Process Flax Hull Lignans support multiple body systems.  They are very high in anti-oxidants, more potent than the darkest leafy green vegetable – kale! Kale is a vegetable that has one of the highest ORAC values(the measurement of antioxidant). Kale’s ORAC value is 1770, while concentrated Flax Hull Lignans have an ORAC value of 19,600! Prunes are the fruit with the highest ORAC value at 6,770 which still doesn’t compare to Flax Hull Lignans.

FHL is 8% oil and fat, and 55% of that fat is ALA (Alpha-Linolenic Acid).  If a person were to consume 2.5g (3/4 tsp) daily of FHL, they would be consuming approximately 110mg ALA.  The National Academy of Sciences, USA has given daily recommendations of ALA to be 110mg for women and 160mg for men. 1 scoop of FHL give approximately 220 mg of ALA.

There is 2.1g of dietary fiber and 1.4g of protein in each scoop of FHL

There are no chemicals used in extracting the lignans from the shell and therefore, no chemicals in our flax hull lignans! ALL liquid forms of flax hull lignans have used chemical extraction and should be avoided.

Flax Hull Lignans – 1 Month Supply, 32 Servings With Serving Scoop Included.

*Our lignans contain the FULL SPECTRUM of 17 lignans that are used in the studies.  Don’t be fooled by cheap imitations, chemically extracted single lignan products that only extract SDG.  These chemically extracted lignans are dead, as their enzymes have been killed (unlike our Flax Hull Lignans!).  Chemical residues are also something to be concerned about with chemically extracted lignans.  Don’t be fooled by imitations!
          </p>

          <ul class="prodpg__bullets">
            <li>Very High in Antioxidants</li>
            <li>Great in cereal, yogurt, or baking</li>
            <li>No chemicals used in processing</li>
            <li>150–300 mg SDG per 1.5 tsp serving</li>
            <li>Full Spectrum 17 lignans present</li>
            <li>1 scoop equals 220 mg ALA (Alpha-Linolenic Acid)</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="product-cta">
            <button
              class="btn-cta add-to-cart"
              data-sku="fhl-single"
              data-price={String(PRICE_FHL_CENTS)}
              data-qty="1"
              data-name="Flax Hull Lignans (Single Jar)"
              data-image="/images/products/flaxfield.jpg"
            >
              Add to Cart
            </button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card: Ancient Seeds & Grains (Single Jar) -->
        <article class="prodpg__card">
          <div class="card-photo">
            <img
              src="/images/products/flaxsinglefield.jpg"
              alt="FLH Ancient Seeds & Grains (Single Jar)"
              loading="eager"
              decoding="async"
              class="card-photo-img"
            />
          </div>

          <h3 class="prodpg__title">
            FLH Ancient Seeds &amp; Grains
            <span class="unit">(Single Jar)</span>
          </h3>

          <p class="prodpg__price">{PRICE_ANCIENT_DISPLAY}</p>

          <p class="prodpg__desc">
            MCP Processed “Better Than Organic” Flax Hull Lignans are the highest grade you can get.
            We also have MCP Processed commercial lignans which are also high quality, but they aren’t
            as strict standards as this one.
            <br /><br />
            The Organic industry has changed over the past few years, and not for the better. The word
            “organic” now allows for cross-pollinated GMO products to be used in anything that is certified
            organic, up to 8%. We feel this is a problem when many customers are buying organic thinking
            they are getting non-GMO. Our flax hull lignans are no longer certified organic, but they are
            certified “USA Ancient Seeds” which holds a HIGHER STANDARD than “organic”.
            <br /><br />
            We know that there is going to be an educational period where our customers are going to have
            to learn about this new certification and why we are doing it, but we want these lignans to not
            only hold up to organic standards, but NON-GMO standards as well. Nothing has changed in our
            product, just the paperwork. We still have all the standards of organic, we just have a few
            higher standards that we are embracing.
            <br /><br />
            There is no GMO flax used in these flax hull lignans. On that note, our manufacturer always
            avoids GMO sources for commercial lignans as well but he says that it’s possible to get some
            every once in awhile if he isn’t specifically purchasing “Non-GMO” flax – which is reserved
            for this product and costs more.
          </p>

          <ul class="prodpg__bullets">
            <li>Very High in Antioxidants</li>
            <li>Great in cereal, yogurt, or baking</li>
            <li>No chemicals used in processing</li>
            <li>150–300 mg SDG per 1.5 tsp serving</li>
            <li>Full Spectrum 17 lignans present</li>
            <li>1 scoop equals 220 mg ALA (Alpha-Linolenic Acid)</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="product-cta">
            <button
              class="btn-cta add-to-cart"
              data-sku="ancient-single"
              data-price={String(PRICE_ANCIENT_CENTS)}
              data-qty="1"
              data-name="FLH Ancient Seeds & Grains (Single Jar)"
              data-image="/images/products/flaxsinglefield.jpg"
            >
              Add to Cart
            </button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    /* ---------- HERO (faded background image) ---------- */
    .prod-hero{
      position:relative; isolation:isolate; overflow:hidden;
      min-height:180px; border-radius:14px; background:#fff; margin:8px 0 18px;
    }
    .prod-hero .bg{
      position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%;
      object-fit:cover; opacity:.18; z-index:-1;
    }
    .prod-hero .inner{
      padding:20px 16px 18px; max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto;
    }
    .prod-hero h1{ margin:0 0 8px; font-size:clamp(2rem,3vw,2.4rem); }
    .prod-hero p{ margin:0; max-width:70ch; }

    /* ---------- PRODUCT GRID ---------- */
    .sr-only{ position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; padding:0; margin:-1px; overflow:hidden; clip:rect(0,0,0,0); border:0; }

    .prodpg { padding: 0 0 48px; }
    .prodpg__container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }

    section.prodpg .prodpg__grid {
      display: grid !important;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      row-gap: 16px !important;
      column-gap: 32px !important;
      margin: 10px 0 24px;
    }
    @media (min-width: 800px) {
      section.prodpg .prodpg__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)) !important; }
      section.prodpg .prodpg__card { margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      section.prodpg .prodpg__card:nth-child(odd) { margin-right: 32px; }
    }

    section.prodpg .prodpg__card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
      display: grid;
      gap: .65rem;
      justify-items: start;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: none;
    }

    /* Vertical card image: 3:4 frame that crops wide photos nicely */
    .card-photo{
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #f7f7f7;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
    }
    .card-photo-img{
      width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
    }

    .prodpg__title{ margin: .25rem 0 0; line-height: 1.2; }
    .prodpg__title .unit{ display:block; font-weight:600; }

    section.prodpg .prodpg__price { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    section.prodpg .prodpg__desc { line-height: 1.5; color: #374151; font-size: .98rem; margin: .25rem 0 .5rem; }
    .prodpg__bullets { margin: 0 0 .5rem; padding-left: 1.1rem; }
    .prodpg__bullets li { margin: .25rem 0; }

    .product-cta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .product-cta .add-to-cart{
      display:inline-flex !important; width:auto !important; min-width:160px;
      align-items:center; justify-content:center; white-space:nowrap; align-self:start;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
